MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_001: Hey, Fianna. With great weather like this, it's hard\nto complain, huh?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_002: Ah... Um... Hello...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_003: Man, she hardly seems to talk to anyone who\nisn't Talimun...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_004: Too bad I'm such a sucker for the hard-to-get type.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_005: I've been involved in my fair share of conquests\nthough. Time to put that experience to work.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_006: Heh. Something like this oughta do the trick.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_007: Hey there, Fianna. I'm not interrupting, am I?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_008: Wh-what is it? Are you hurt?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_009: No, no. This isn't about work. No need for healing\nright now.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_010: I got you something, actually. Since I seem to scare\nyou all the time, I wanted to make it up to you.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_011: No need. I've been avoiding you.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_012: Well, here. I got you some of these fancy sweets.\nI wanted you to know how I feel.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_013: How you feel? Like...honey-covered sweets?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_014: Right. They're pretty popular. People line up to buy\nthem. I wanted you to know I was thinking of you.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_015: You waited in line, thinking of me?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_016: Heh. I nailed it... You still got it, Simon.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_017: I see... You could have simply told me you hate\nme, Simon.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_018: What?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_019: Now, I will return these to you... And take\nmy leave. Goodbye.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_020: H-hey! What just happened? Is there something\nwrong with it?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_C_021: Seems fine to me... Delicious, even.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_001: Ugh. I haven't been able to get a word in with Fianna\nsince I tried to give her that candy.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_002: Whenever I try to catch her alone so we can talk,\njust the two of us, she avoids me. What do I do now?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_003: Huh? What is this? A rope?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_004: What the hell? A snare trap? What's this doing here?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_005: I'm sorry!
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_006: What in the— Hey!
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_007: Fianna! What're you doing?! What's this rope doing\naround my— Am I in the snare?!
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_008: Yes. I set the snare for you. I borrowed it from one\nof the Vandahl warehouses...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_009: I was asked to heal the wounded, and I was worried\nI'd need something like this were I to treat you...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_010: Wait, wait! What do you take me for, some kind\nof madman killer on the loose?!
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_011: Don't you...hate me? Isn't that why you kept trying\nto catch me alone? To finally kill me?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_012: N-no! Of course not! There's been a huge\nmisunderstanding! I just wanted to talk, I swear!
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_013: What? But you gave me sweets... Are you saying\nyou had no ill intentions all this time?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_014: Ill intentions? No! I gave you that candy because\nI thought you'd like it!
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_015: O-oh! I'm sorry! It's just...you bought me sweets...\nIf you don't hate me, why would you do that?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_016: Well, hell. You could've just said that then.\nDamn it all... Tyah!
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_017: Next time, let's just get some food you like, and we'll\neat that together, alright? As friends?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_018: After all the stress I've caused you?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_019: You're kind, Simon... Thank you...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_020: If you're willing to go to so much trouble just for me,\nI'll happily have dinner with you... Heehee.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_021: Whew! You had me worried there for a minute,\nbut I'm glad we were finally able to talk.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_022: I'll leave you alone for now, then. When you decide\non a place, we'll set a date. Sound good?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_023: Ah... Before you go... There are a few more traps\nyou should be aware of.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_024: Hey! Just what do you think I'm capable of exactly?!\nI'm a normal human being! I'm not even a demigod!
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_025: That may be, but you are formidable still. I can't\nhope to face you head-on.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_B_026: You are much scarier than I am, Fianna...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_001: Ahh... Nothing like a nice meal with a beautiful\nwoman, I say. Shall we?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_002: One moment, Simon. I need to add some of this first.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_003: What are you doing? How much extra spice do you\nneed to add?!
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_004: What do you mean? It's delicious! I love spicy food.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_005: Oh... I see. To each their own, I guess.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_006: Would you like to try some, Simon? Here, let me\njust put a dab on the side for you...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_007: No, no! That's fine! Spicy food doesn't sit well\nwith me...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_008: I see... So then you don't like it... I'm sorry. I thought\nwe had something in common for a moment.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_009: Well, it's not that I hate spicy food... You know what?\nLet's do it.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_010: Really? You'll try it? Then allow me to do\nthe honors...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_011: I don't think I can see the food anymore...\nThat's probably enough, right?
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_012: Not yet... We're halfway there now.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_013: H-halfway?! Hey, the chef's gonna think you don't\nthink his food's any good!
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_014: It's fine. Talimun said we can expense the meal,\nso the company will pay for it. We'll tip well.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_015: Talimun said I have a wonderful sense for flavor\nand that I should cherish it.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_016: He also told me he can tell the quality of a spicy meal\nwithout trying it, because he has a special skill...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_017: That bastard... Of course he weaseled his way out.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_018: And you're sure Ursula signed off? The cost of all\nthose spices has to be significant!
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_019: She said seeing the two of us satisfied was worth\nany price—and to leave her and Talimun out of it.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_020: Damn her... Of course she'd look out for Talimun\nand leave me to hang.
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_021: Heehee. Now, before it gets cold...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_022: Right... Down the hatch...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_023: Rraugh! Eughhh. Ahhh...
MID_SE_Sim_Fia_A_024: I'm glad you enjoyed it. Heehee. It seems we have\nsomething in common after all.